--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

vllm_patch/in_engine_head.patch is a diff against vLLM
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Applying it produces a modified copy of vLLM; that copy remains
subject to Apache-2.0, including its notice and attribution requirements.
The patch adds new files and modifies existing ones under vllm/; the upstream
copyright headers are preserved by the diff.

This project imports, but does not redistribute, vLLM, Ray, PyTorch,
Transformers, Datasets, scikit-learn, SciPy, NumPy and Pillow. Each is used
under its own license.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No dataset content is redistributed. verifier/bench_mix_manifest.json lists
dataset-native record identifiers only; verifier/src/build_records.py fetches
the content from the original sources, each of which carries its own terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

weights/head.pt is a small classifier (67,329 parameters) trained for this
work. It is derived from features extracted from open-weight models; no model
weights from those projects are included or redistributed here.
